Data provenance and attribution
===============================

Tabulated election figures published in the CSV outputs under this repository
were sourced from the Electoral Commission of India’s public results website at:

  https://results.eci.gov.in/

(or successor URLs under that domain), including paths consistent with the May 2026
Tamil Nadu Assembly Constituency results (for example `ResultAcGenMay2026/`).

Those electoral counts and labels remain official publications of the Election
Commission of India or relevant electoral authorities. These CSV extracts were produced
from HTML tables published there; this repository does not
represent endorsement by ECI and does not claim ownership over underlying tabulated results.

Before citing aggregated counts or derivatives for editorial, compliance, or
legal contexts, verify figures against the live portal or gazetted notifications.

See README.md for limitations on extraction fidelity (filters applied to noisy rows,
extra `col_*` columns from markup glue text, party naming inconsistencies across exports).
